cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Widget Éphéméride astro
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Daniel
    family-names: Dubois
    email: daniel@web-eau.net
repository-code: 'https://github.com/astrosemantics/widget_ephemeride'
abstract: >-
  An all-in-one Android widget (KWGT, 4×6 format) for the
  sky of the day, based on the phone's position: sunrise and
  sunset, moonrise, moonset and phase, dusk and astronomical
  night, tonight's sky rating out of 100 (clouds, Moon,
  seeing), the day's sky events (meteor showers, equinoxes,
  Moon phases, visible planets), an astronomy word of the day
  with a Wikipedia link, and an "on this day" fact from the
  history of astronomy (633 facts). Turns red at night to
  preserve dark adaptation. Texts in French.
keywords:
  - Android
  - Widget
  - Astronomy
  - Ephemeris
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 2.0.0
date-released: '2026-10-26'
